      "source_path": "data/raw/bilibili/BV1FJxc6zEzg/p01/subtitle.01.raw.json",
      "start_ms": 2185520,
      "end_ms": 2192340,
      "quote": "昨夜双死\n死亡顺序不分先后\n6号九号倒牌\n没有遗言\n6号九号请灭灯\n取牌离场",
